# ── Personal data / secrets — never commit ──────────────────────────────
# The repo ships a placeholder profile at rules/my.md; the *filled-in* copy
# the installer writes into a vault lives at .claude/rules/my.md and must
# never be committed.
.claude/rules/my.md

# Any personal or credential-bearing notes that leak in.
**/credentials*
**/*.env
**/.env
# ...except the pinned-revision file the installer reads; it carries no secrets
# and a clone without it cannot install.
!install/dependencies.env
**/secrets*
**/token*
**/api_key*
**/apikey*

# ── Vault content the repo must never carry ─────────────────────────────
# Actual papers, extracted figures, and the user's hand-written notes.
*.pdf
0ai_wiki/
_attachments/
Projects/
Research/
Resources/
Daily Notes/
Inbox/
Archive/
Templates/   # note: the repo's own templates live under /templates, not /Templates

# ── Obsidian internal state ─────────────────────────────────────────────
.obsidian/
.trash/

# ── OS / editor noise ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.code-workspace

# ── Python ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
